hed, done, delete, push, prune, and orphaned-worktree cleanup — and\nstream a live agent run's `session.log` over Server-Sent Events, the network\ntwin of the TUI's `l` tail.\n\n## Changes\n\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"ls /workspace/docs/jobs/archive/ | tail -3; head -8 /workspace/docs/jobs/archive/farmer_part-2-of-web-ui-tui-path/tasks.md 2>/dev/null; echo ===; head -20 /workspace/docs/jobs/archive/farmer_part-2-of-web-ui-tui-path/implementation.md 2>/dev/null","time":{"start":1787993085234,"end":1787993085238}},"id":"prt_04cb155200012ALvIV7tGYUYz7","sessionID":"ses_fb356b356ffep6vyvmzQINQBoz","messageID":"msg_04cb13f1b001NIoCc2R8dW3Wiu"}}
